<h1>Knowledge workspace</h1>
<p>A local demonstration of Rails, packs, ROM, RES, Elasticsearch and cited retrieval.</p>
<p>Use demo-a or demo-b. These are public demonstration credentials, not a production identity system.</p>
<%= form_with url: session_path do |form| %>
  <%= form.label :token, "Demo token" %>
  <%= form.text_field :token, required: true %>
  <%= form.submit "Open workspace" %>
<% end %>
